[*]
[*] K != N waveform layout (issue #66): one run with k_len = 5 on the 4x4 array
[*] (K != N case 6, ones_k5: A and B all 1 for k < 5, random filler after).
[*] Busy for k_len + 2N = 13 cycles, k_len + 2N - 2 = 11 of them compute steps.
[*] From the repository root:
[*]   make sim-systolic_top
[*]   gtkwave -r sim/waves/report.gtkwaverc sim/waves/systolic_top_klen.gtkw
[*] state: 0 IDLE, 1 CLEAR, 2 COMPUTE, 3 CAPTURE, 4 DONE.
[*] Markers: A start taken (run_k_len = 5), B step 0, C step 10 = T - 1, D done.
